kdal (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Devices report their resource demand (debugfs kdal/demand, JSON).
  * KUnit suites can be built into kdal.ko (KDAL_KUNIT=y).
  * Builds and loads against Linux v6.18; registry and init fixes.
  * kdality: init, lint and simulate fixes; paths validated.
  * The language, compiler and editor plugins are frozen.

 -- Phuc Nguyen <trong552003@gmail.com>  Tue, 24 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000

kdal (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * kdalc compiler: lexer, parser, semantic analysis, C code generator.
  * kdality CLI: compile, init, simulate, lint, test-gen, dt-gen, kdalctl.
  * Standard library: uart, spi, i2c, gpio, gpu, npu device headers.
  * CMake build system with find_package(KDAL) support.
  * Public kernel-space headers and compiler headers.

 -- Phuc Nguyen <trong552003@gmail.com>  Sat, 12 Apr 2026 12:00:00 +0000
